OL,3,GNEWSAGuests evacuated from 'damaged'
OL,4,Ahistoric hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic hotel was evacuated after
OL,7,Fpart of the ceiling and masonry above a
OL,8,Fbay window came down in one of its
OL,9,Fbedrooms.
OL,11,FDorset Council's building control team
OL,12,Fsaid part of South Street and nearby
OL,13,Fpedestrian access routes have been
OL,14,Fclosed as a precaution due to the
OL,15,F"structural damage" at The Bear in
OL,16,FWareham.
OL,18,FThe room was unoccupied at the time and
OL,19,Fthere have been no reports of any
OL,20,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
